              "bin": 1,
              "why": "Canada is a country in North America."
            }
          ],
          "reveal": true,
          "big": true,
          "readme": "Read each card. Is it a continent?"
        },
        "cap": "Continent or not?"
      },
      {
        "t": "mistake",
        "html": "Children often call Africa or Asia a country. A continent is much bigger: it holds many countries. Remember: there are only seven continents."
      },
      {
        "t": "note",
        "html": "<b>For the grown-up.</b> Sing or chant the seven continents together. Many children learn them fastest with a tune."
